			GoodHealth: "Very few interactions detected. Remember: ModHarmony only sees what tModLoader exposes."
			BadHealth: "Several interactions detected. Disable mods one at a time, starting with the red/orange ones."
			Footer: "— ModHarmony: detect, explain, investigate, suggest. It never modifies other mods."
